         Both URLs are root-relative on purpose and carry no version
         query string: Google fetches the site icon for a hostname from
         that host's /favicon.ico, and the favicon URL must stay stable.
         The image crawler (Googlebot-Image) has to be able to reach
         both files, so wwwroot/robots.txt allows them. -->
